<title>LATVIA: JELGAVA BUILDING MATERIAL Q1 PROFIT 112 LATS.</title>
<headline>JELGAVA BUILDING MATERIAL Q1 PROFIT 112 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jelgava Building Material made a tiny profit of 112 lats in the first quarter on turnover of 19,112 lats, the stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the stock exchange said that the company's assets came to 1.71 million lats in the first three months.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
